# Each passage contains its policy title, number, section labels, and original source URL.
# Read the Scope section and linked policy before applying a passage to a specific person/campus.
# Policy text can change after this retrieval date; recheck the source before relying on it.
# The section heading History describes earlier versions, not necessarily current requirements.
